# PDF Templates Folder

Place your PDF templates here (e.g., admission_registration.pdf).

The system will:
1. First try to load your template from /pdf-templates/admission_registration.pdf
2. If template exists, fill in the form fields and/or place text at X/Y coordinates
3. If template not found, generate a blank PDF with the receipt details

For the template:
- Add form fields with names like: ReceiptNo, StudentName, SchoolId, Class, FeeAmount, Discount, Advance, OldDue, NewDue, PaymentMode, TotalAmount, AmountPaid, Date, FeeType, Year
- Or the system will place text at default X/Y coordinates
